        // Instead we can rely on fuzzer finding a pool that somehow passes, but that won't work without code.
        // The POOLFACTORY is an external dependency; we cannot rely on it being set up by fuzzer.
        // Therefore we must deploy a complete adversarial environment: a faux POOLFACTORY that marks helper as curated.
        // This is an adversarial helper as required.
